	(text "NIVO = 1 (Q2 vodi):\n  VSET = 3,3 x (15k||3k24)/(1k + 15k||3k24) = 2,40 V\nNIVO = 0:  VSET = 3,3 x 15k/16k = 3,094 V\nEN_N = 1 (R9 pull-up, i dok MCU ne krene)\n  ili OCP = 1:  VSET = 0 -> petlja ugasena\nC14 10n: filtar VSET"
