	(text "PA2 NIVO: TCA0 WO2 (impulsi petlje, 62,5 ns korak)\nPD2 IAMP: AC0 AINP0, prag = interni DACREF (umesto MCP6561 + PWM)\n   + ADC AIN2 (struja petlje); PD4 VLOOP, PD5 VRET: ADC\nAC0 -> event sistem -> TCB capture: vreme odgovora uredjaja bez CPU\nPA4/PA5 USART0 (ALT1) ka maticnoj ploci, PC0/PC1 USART1 dijagnostika\nPA7 LED (moze i AC0 OUT za osciloskop)\nUPDI (PF7) i RESET (PF6) na J1: programiranje / bootloader sa maticne\nKristal 16 MHz na PA0/PA1 (XOSCHF, FRQRANGE 16M)\nEN_N ima pull-up R9: petlja ugasena dok je MCU u resetu"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 284.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1))
			(justify left top))
		(uuid "4f43a441-5217-42a6-ae52-ae9b717376fc"))
